post_install() {
  cat <<'MSG'
cheesecloth is installed but not enabled. Put this node's settings in
/etc/cheesecloth/config.yaml ('cheesecloth config --init --overlay-net NET'
writes them), then: systemctl enable --now cheesecloth
A node with a network configured and no state starts a cluster; one that is
to join an existing cluster is enrolled once by hand with --join-key. See
/usr/share/doc/cheesecloth/README.md
MSG
}
